	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「新ULTRAMAN SUIT PROJECT」第１弾！『ULTRAMAN』よりオリジナル武器を付属してULTRAMAN SUIT TIGAが登場！",
			"• 清水栄一先生完全描きおろし。",
			"• 赤・紫の装甲をグロスインジェクション、銀色はエクストラフィニッシュでボディ表面の質感を再現。",
			"• オリジナル武器のゼペリオンスピアはクリアパーツで成形。",
			"• 広範囲な可動域で必殺技ゼペリオン光線の構えポーズを再現可能。",
			"• 必殺ポーズを彩るエフェクトパーツも付属。",
			"• 胸部に収めることができるLEDユニットが付属。胸と目を光らせることができる。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"New ULTRAMAN SUIT PROJECT\" first installment! ULTRAMAN SUIT TIGA is now available with original weapons from \"ULTRAMAN\"!",
			"• Completely drawn by Eiichi Shimizu.",
			"• The red and purple armor is gloss-injected, and the silver is an extra finish to reproduce the texture of the body surface.",
			"• The original weapon Zeperion Spear is molded with clear parts.",
			"• A wide range of motion allows you to recreate the stance pose of the special move Zeperion Ray.",
			"• Effect parts are also included to color the special pose.",
			"• Comes with an LED unit that can be placed in the chest. You can make your chest and eyes shine."
		]
	},
